  "description": "The 2023 scheme on the A380 with a panel the full height of the upper side from just aft of the 'Emirates' title back to the tail's red sweep, under which it runs: Wimbledon purple at its front fading into green. On it 'OFFICIAL PARTNER' in white capitals, then two white line drawings of tennis players either side of The Championships' roundel (purple ring, green centre, white crossed rackets and ball), and a scatter of small white stars low toward the sweep. The panel covers where the Arabic title would be; the rest is the 2023 scheme.",
